      "sentences": [
        {
          "sid": "classifiers-t1-s01",
          "c": "我要一杯咖啡。",
          "j": "ngo5 jiu3 jat1 bui1 gaa3 fe1.",
          "e": "I want a cup of coffee.",
          "note": "Different nouns take different classifiers, and 杯 (bui1) \"cup / glass\" is the one for drinks — 一杯咖啡 (jat1 bui1 gaa3 fe1) \"a cup of coffee\", 一杯水 (jat1 bui1 seoi2) \"a glass of water\". (See the lesson note above for the general idea.)",
          "bd": [
            {
              "c": "我要",
              "j": "ngo5 jiu3",
              "e": "I want"
            },
            {
              "c": "一杯",
              "j": "jat1 bui1",
              "e": "one cup of"
            },
            {
              "c": "咖啡",
              "j": "gaa3 fe1",
              "e": "coffee"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "sid": "classifiers-t1-s02",
          "c": "呢本書好好睇。",
          "j": "ni1 bun2 syu1 hou2 hou2 tai2.",
          "e": "This book is very good.",
          "note": "本 (bun2) is the classifier for books and bound things — 一本書 (jat1 bun2 syu1) \"a book\". Also note 好好睇 (hou2 hou2 tai2): the first 好 (hou2) is \"very\", and 好睇 (hou2 tai2), literally \"good-to-look-at\", means \"nice / good\" (of things you watch or read).",
          "bd": [
            {
              "c": "呢本",
              "j": "ni1 bun2",
              "e": "this [book]"
            },
            {
              "c": "書",
              "j": "syu1",
              "e": "book"
            },
            {
              "c": "好好睇",
              "j": "hou2 hou2 tai2",
              "e": "very good (to read)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "sid": "classifiers-t1-s03",
          "c": "嗰隻狗係邊個㗎？",
          "j": "go2 zek3 gau2 hai6 bin1 go3 gaa3?",
          "e": "Whose dog is that?",
          "note": "嗰 (go2) is \"that\" (vs 呢 ni1 \"this\"), and 隻 (zek3) is the classifier for animals — 一隻狗 (jat1 zek3 gau2) \"a dog\". The 㗎 (gaa3) on the end just makes the question sound natural and casual.",
          "bd": [
            {
              "c": "嗰隻",
              "j": "go2 zek3",
              "e": "that [animal]"
            },
            {
              "c": "狗",
              "j": "gau2",
              "e": "dog"
            },
            {
              "c": "係",
              "j": "hai6",
              "e": "is"
            },
            {
              "c": "邊個",
              "j": "bin1 go3",
              "e": "whose / who"
            },
            {
              "c": "㗎",
              "j": "gaa3",
              "e": "(particle)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "sid": "classifiers-t1-s04",
          "c": "我買咗兩件衫。",
          "j": "ngo5 maai5 zo2 loeng5 gin6 saam1.",
          "e": "I bought two tops.",
          "note": "件 (gin6) is the classifier for clothing — 兩件衫 (loeng5 gin6 saam1) \"two tops\". (And note 兩 loeng5, not 二 ji6, before a classifier — see the numbers lesson.)",
          "bd": [
            {
              "c": "我買咗",
              "j": "ngo5 maai5 zo2",
              "e": "I bought"
            },
            {
              "c": "兩件",
              "j": "loeng5 gin6",
              "e": "two [items]"
            },
            {
              "c": "衫",
              "j": "saam1",
              "e": "tops"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "sid": "classifiers-t1-s05",
          "c": "呢啲生果幾錢呀？",
          "j": "ni1 di1 saang1 gwo2 gei2 cin2 aa3?",
          "e": "How much is this fruit?",
          "note": "啲 (di1) is the all-purpose classifier for plurals and uncountable things — 呢啲 (ni1 di1) \"these\", 嗰啲 (go2 di1) \"those\". Use it where English would say \"some\" or make a noun plural. 生果 (saang1 gwo2) is \"fruit\".",
          "bd": [
            {
              "c": "呢啲",
              "j": "ni1 di1",
              "e": "these"
            },
            {
              "c": "生果",
              "j": "saang1 gwo2",
              "e": "fruit"
            },
            {
              "c": "幾錢",
              "j": "gei2 cin2",
              "e": "how much"
            },
            {
              "c": "呀",
              "j": "aa3",
              "e": "(particle)"
            }
          ]
        }
